        "ConnectionStringEncrypted": "42zRCUhMMbzhRymFS0kibtXWzcPGWUHtYluhpWpxJV7C0nECYg9ZmcwTqYTkEDQ7gTr9w01KYcXDFaCJY2ghe9dWeYNPQqmkaRPV7Gm0rUaNGI0="
      }
    }
  },
